{"ticker":"DOW","updated":"2026-10-30T22:45:08Z","profile":{"longName":"Dow Inc.","shortName":"Dow Inc.","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Chemicals","country":"United States","website":"https://www.dow.com","fullTimeEmployees":31600,"marketCap":25118703616,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":18.881271,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.5894611,"pegRatio":38.89,"targetMeanPrice":34.76471,"targetHighPrice":41.0,"targetLowPrice":30.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":17,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.13,"earningsGrowth":6.75,"grossMargins":0.110080004,"operatingMargins":0.06781,"profitMargins":-0.02105,"totalRevenue":42612998144,"beta":0.409,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":42.74,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":20.93,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.16},"summary":"Dow Inc., through its subsidiaries, provides various materials science solutions for packaging, infrastructure, mobility, and consumer applications in the United States, Canada, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, India, the Asia Pacific, and Latin America. The company operates through Packaging & Specialty Plastics, Industrial Intermediates & Infrastructure, and Performance Materials & Coatings segments. The Packaging & Specialty Plastics segment provides ethylene, propylene, polyethylene, and aromatics products; and other ethylene derivatives, such as polyolefin elastomers, ethylene vinyl acetate, and ethylene propylene diene monomer rubber. The Industrial Intermediates & Infrastructure segment offers polyurethanes, including propylene oxide, propylene glycol, and polyether polyols; aromatic isocyanates and fully formulated polyurethane systems; and chlor-alkali and vinyl comprising chlorine and caustic soda, ethylene dichloride, and vinyl chloride monomer; and construction chemicals consisting of cellulose ethers, redispersible latex powders, and acrylic emulsions, as well as coatings, adhesives, sealants, elastomers, and composites. The Performance Materials & Coatings segment provides architectural paints and coatings, and industrial coatings; and acrylics-based building blocks, silicon metals, siloxanes, and intermediates. The company also engages in the property and casualt","summary_zh":"陶氏公司透過其子公司為美國、加拿大、歐洲、中東、非洲、印度、亞太地區和拉丁美洲的包裝、基礎設施、移動性和消費者應用提供各種材料科學解決方案。該公司透過包裝和特殊塑膠、工業中間體和基礎設施以及高性能材料和塗料部門運作。包裝和特殊塑膠部門提供乙烯、丙烯、聚乙烯和芳烴產品；以及其他乙烯衍生物，如聚烯烴彈性體、乙烯醋酸乙烯酯、三元乙丙橡膠等。工業中間體和基礎設施部門提供聚氨酯，包括環氧丙烷、丙二醇和聚醚多元醇；芳香族異氰酸酯和全配方聚氨酯系統；氯鹼和乙烯基，包括氯和燒鹼、二氯乙烷和氯乙烯單體；以及由纖維素醚、可再分散乳膠粉和丙烯酸乳液組成的建築化學品，以及塗料、彈性體劑、密封劑、化合物、彈性劑和密封劑。功能性材料和塗料部門提供建築油漆和塗料以及工業塗料；以及丙烯酸類結構單元、矽金屬、矽氧烷和中間體。該公司還從事財產和意外傷害業務","sector_zh":"基礎材料","industry_zh":"化學品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":24.23,"h":24.745,"l":24.07,"c":24.41,"v":12152500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":24.25,"h":24.52,"l":23.79,"c":23.93,"v":11528200},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":23.76,"h":23.985,"l":23.2,"c":23.91,"v":11630400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":23.9,"h":24.92,"l":23.775,"c":24.5,"v":18476700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":24.34,"h":24.346,"l":23.12,"c":23.98,"v":15488100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":23.845,"h":24.36,"l":23.7,"c":24.14,"v":10959400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":23.94,"h":24.46,"l":23.715,"c":23.83,"v":11492700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":23.66,"h":25.14,"l":23.66,"c":25.02,"v":25711700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":25.0,"h":25.49,"l":24.87,"c":25.04,"v":14732800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":25.215,"h":25.38,"l":24.045,"c":24.17,"v":13192300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":24.4,"h":24.88,"l":24.185,"c":24.48,"v":11070800},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":24.6,"h":25.77,"l":24.185,"c":24.54,"v":14775200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":24.81,"h":24.99,"l":23.89,"c":24.11,"v":15350400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":24.15,"h":24.15,"l":23.35,"c":23.49,"v":19106700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":23.35,"h":23.39,"l":22.94,"c":23.17,"v":12901800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":23.54,"h":23.697,"l":22.84,"c":22.86,"v":11016900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":22.97,"h":23.38,"l":22.91,"c":23.13,"v":11913600},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":23.02,"h":23.025,"l":22.165,"c":22.2,"v":16437600},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":22.43,"h":23.2,"l":22.345,"c":22.96,"v":12623800},{"t":"