successor to a Michigan corporation, of the same name, organized in 1897. The Company's principal executive offices are located at 2211 H.H. Dow Way, Midland, Michigan 48674.","zh":"陶氏公司於 2018 年 8 月 30 日根據特拉華州法律註冊成立，作為陶氏化學公司及其合併子公司（“TDCC”，與陶氏公司合稱“陶氏”或“公司”）的控股公司。陶氏公司透過全資子公司 TDCC 經營其所有業務，TDCC 於 1947 年根據特拉華州法律成立，是一家成立於 1897 年的密西根州同名公司的繼承者。公司的主要執行辦公室位於 2211 H.H. Dow Way, Midland, Michigan 48674。"},{"en":"Except as otherwise indicated by the context, the term \"Union Carbide\" means Union Carbide Corporation, a wholly owned subsidiary of the Company. Additionally, the term \"Diamond Infrastructure Solutions\" means Dow InfraCo, LLC, an entity that owns and operates infrastructure assets at certain Dow locations on the U.S. Gulf Coast and became a consolidated variable interest entity on May 1, 2025.","zh":"除非文中另有說明，「聯合碳化物公司」一詞是指本公司的全資子公司聯合碳化物公司。此外，「鑽石基礎設施解決方案」一詞是指 Dow InfraCo, LLC，該實體在美國墨西哥灣沿岸的某些陶氏工廠擁有並運營基礎設施資產，並於 2025 年 5 月 1 日成為合併的可變利益實體。"},{"en":"Dow is one of the world's leading materials science companies, serving customers in high-growth markets such as packaging, infrastructure, mobility and consumer applications. The Company's global breadth, asset integration and scale, customer-focused innovation and leading business positions enable it to achieve profitable growth and help deliver a sustainable future. Dow operates manufacturing sites in 29 countries and employs approximately 34,600 people. Dow delivered sales of approximately $40 billion in 2025. Learn more about Dow at www.dow.com.","zh":"陶氏化學是世界領先的材料科學公司之一，為包裝、基礎設施、行動和消費應用等高成長市場的客戶提供服務。該公司的全球業務廣度、資產整合和規模、以客戶為中心的創新以及領先的業務地位使其能夠實現盈利增長並幫助實現可持續的未來。陶氏化學在 29 個國家設有生產基地，約有 34,600 名員工。陶氏化學公司到 2025 年的銷售額約為 400 億美元。了解有關陶氏化學公司的更多資訊，請訪問 www.dow.com。"}],"markets":[{"en":"The Company conducts its worldwide operations through six global businesses which are organized into the following operating segments: Packaging & Specialty Plastics, Industrial Intermediates & Infrastructure and Performance Materials & Coatings. Corporate contains the reconciliation between the totals for the operating segments and the Company's totals. The Company did not aggregate any operating segments when determining its reportable segments. See Part II, Item 7. Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations and Note 25 to the Consolidated Financial Statements for additional information concerning the Company's operating segments.","zh":"該公司透過六家全球業務開展全球業務，這些業務分為以下業務部門：包裝和特殊塑膠、工業中間體和基礎設施以及高性能材料和塗料。本公司包含營運部門總計與公司總計之間的調節表。本公司在決定報告分部時並未合併任何經營分部。有關公司經營分部的更多資訊，請參閱第二部分第 7 項“管理層對財務狀況和經營業績的討論與分析”以及合併財務報表附註 25。"},{"en":"The Packaging & Specialty Plastics operating segment consists of two highly integrated global businesses: Hydrocarbons & Energy and Packaging and Specialty Plastics. The segment employs the industry's broadest polyolefin product portfolio, supported by the Company's proprietary catalyst and manufacturing process technologies. These differentiators, plus collaboration at the customer's design table, enable the segment to deliver more reliable, durable, higher-performing solutions designed for recyclability and enhanced plastics circularity and sustainability. The segment serves customers, brand owners and ultimately consumers in key markets including food and specialty packaging; industrial and consumer packaging; health and hygiene; caps, closures and pipe applications; consumer durables; mobility; and infrastructure.","zh":"包裝和特殊塑膠業務部門由兩個高度一體化的全球業務組成：碳氫化合物和能源以及包裝和特殊塑膠。該部門採用業界最廣泛的聚烯烴產品組合，並獲得公司專有催化劑和製造流程技術的支援。這些差異化因素加上客戶設計桌上的協作，使該部門能夠提供更可靠、耐用、性能更高的解決方案，旨在實現可回收性並增強塑膠的循環性和可持續性。該部門為食品和特殊包裝等關鍵市場的客戶、品牌所有者和最終消費者提供服務；工業和消費品包裝；健康和衛生；蓋子、封閉件和管道應用；耐用消費品；流動性；和基礎設施。"}],"customers":[{"en":"In 2025, the Industrial Solutions business successfully completed investments to expand alkoxylation capacity in the United States and similarly, mechanically completed investments in Europe and will begin product qualification and ramp-up activities in early 2026. These investments built on previously completed capacity expansions, collectively increasing the Company's global alkoxylation capacity by 70 percent versus the 2020 baseline. The additional capacity supports increasing demand across a wide range of fast-growing end-markets including home and personal care, industrial and institutional cleaning solutions and pharmaceuticals. The investments are supported by supply agreements with customers, including leading consumer brands.","zh":"2025 年，工業解決方案業務部門成功完成了在美國擴大烷氧基化產能的投資，並在歐洲機械完成了投資，並將於 2026 年初開始產品鑑定和產能提升活動。這些投資建立在先前完成的產能擴張基礎上，與 2020 年基準相比，該公司的全球烷氧基化產能總共增加了 70%。額外的產能可支援各種快速成長的終端市場不斷增長的需求，包括家庭和個人護理、工業和機構清潔解決方案以及藥品。這些投資得到了與客戶（包括領先消費品牌）的供應協議的支持。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Packaging Specialty Plastics","val":19970000000,"zh":"包裝特殊塑料"},{"name":"Industrial Intermediates Infrastructure","val":11163000000,"zh":"工業中間體基礎設施"},{"name":"Performance Materials Coatings","val":8134000000,"zh":"功能性材料塗料"}],"total":39968000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"U.S.Canada","val":15806000000,"zh":"美國 加拿大"},{"name":"US","val":14729000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Restof World Domain","val":12650000000,"zh":"其餘世界域名"},{"name":"Europe Middle East Africa & India","val":12589000000,"zh":"歐洲 中東 非洲和印度"},{"name":"Europe Middle East Africaand India Domain","val":12589000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東、非洲和印度部門"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":7219000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Latin America","val":4354000000,"zh":"拉丁美洲"}],"total":39968000000}},"peers":["DD","MMM","BMY","HON","CTVA"]}}